                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is awesome. It's quite simple to play. It prove a low budget game can be a very good game. Well, I didn't think this game would have cross this boundary: You really need a ladder in this game. A real physical ladder from real life. I tried to use the cane with no luck. At first I didn't think they would have gone this far. Next time I will grab a real latter just to really finish this game. lol",
